0.060"><span begin="02:07.960" end="02:07.960">（</span><span begin="02:07.960" end="02:08.830">Drifting </span><span begin="02:08.830" end="02:09.790">away</span><span begin="02:09.790" end="02:10.060">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.060" end="02:14.170"><span begin="02:10.060" end="02:10.600">When </span><span begin="02:10.600" end="02:10.780">I'm </span><span begin="02:10.780" end="02:10.930">in </span><span begin="02:10.930" end="02:11.140">your </span><span begin="02:11.140" end="02:11.530">arms </span><span begin="02:11.530" end="02:11.710">I </span><span begin="02:11.710" end="02:12.220">start </span><span begin="02:12.220" end="02:14.170">believing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.170" end="02:15.940"><span begin="02:14.170" end="02:14.170">（</span><span begin="02:14.170" end="02:14.530">It's </span><span begin="02:14.530" end="02:14.800">here </span><span begin="02:14.800" end="02:15.160">to </span><span begin="02:15.160" end="02:15.370">stay</span><span begin="02:15.370" end="02:15.940">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.940" end="02:20.410"><span begin="02:15.940" end="02:16.360">But </span><span begin="02:16.360" end="02:16.690">love </span><span begin="02:16.690" end="02:17.050">is </span><span begin="02:17.050" end="02:18.250">only </span><span begin="02:18.250" end="02:18.430">a </span><span begin="02:18.430" end="02:20.410">feeling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.830" end="02:28.750"><span begin="02:20.830" end="02:23.950">Anyway</span><span begin="02:23.950" end="02:26.950">, </span><span begin="02:26.950" end="02:28.750">anyway</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.660" end="02:50.500"><span begin="02:46.660" end="02:47.080">Love </span><span begin="02:47.080" end="02:47.440">is </span><span begin="02:47.440" end="02:48.610">only </span><span begin="02:48.610" end="02:48.760">a </span><span begin="02:48.760" end="02:50.500">feeling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.500" end="02:52.750"><span begin="02:50